  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the woman referenced in the text",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the 'me' in the text 'if he's marrying me then', which refers to the woman being married. The meme uses the visual of the goats to metaphorically represent this woman, particularly the central brown goat looking at the camera, which is mapped onto the woman. The user sees themselves as the 'me' in the text, and thus is projected onto the woman who is being referenced and metaphorically represented by the goat.",
